y.","Our leader died of wounds ","taken in the last battle, and","Troy, our second in command,","has taken over his duties.","Troy has chosen me as his","second, and frankly I hope","he does a good job because","I am NOT ready for command.","Troy has just put us on","alert, so we will have to be","quick in our search of the","ruins.  Apparently our scouts","have spotted archers coming","up the north road to ","reinforce the patrol we just","defeated.  They are too late","but may yet prove a danger."],"map":{"width":40,"height":60,"tiles":[16,18,17,1,16,17,17,16,16,17,1,18,1,17,1,18,18,17,17,16,17,17,18,16,1,18,1,1,1,17,18,18,17,17,16,1,18,18,17,18,16,17,17,18,17,16,1,18,17,17,18,16,1,17,17,16,16,16,18,17,1,18,18,16,16,16,16,1,17,17,1,18,16,17,16,18,16,18,16,18,18,17,17,17,1,17,18,17,18,18,16,18,18,18,1,18,17,17,16,1,16,18,1,1,16,16,17,1,1,18,17,17,17,18,17,18,18,17,1,17,16,18,18,17,17,17,17,16,18,18,16,18,16,16,17,1,16,1,16,17,18,18,16,1,16,1,16,16,18,17,17,67,18,17,18,18,16,17,18,16,16,17,17,18,16,1,16,1,16,17,17,16,1,17,1,18,17,1,17,17,16,16,17,17,1,18,17,16,16,1,1,1,17,16,18,18,16,16,18,16,17,18,17,18,1,1,18,106,17,17,16,16,17,16,16,17,1,16,16,16,18,16,1,1,18,18,18,16,1,16,17,1,17,18,1,1,18,17,17,1,18,18,1,17,17,18,112,108,17,17,17,16,16,18,16,17,1,1,16,16,18,18,1,17,16,18,18,1,17,17,18,17,18,17,1,17,17,16,18,17,16,17,18,16,1,18,108,1,1,1,17,16,17,1,17,16,1,17,18,17,1,16,16,18,18,17,17,1,17,17,16,1,17,18,16,16,1,18,17,17,18,1,1,1,1,18,1,18,18,1,1,16,1,16,1,17,18,18,1,18,17,17,18,1,17,73,18,17,16,1,16,1,17,1,17,18,17,17,16,1,1,17,18,1,18,17,17,18,1,1,17,1,17,1,1,1,16,1,16,17,17,16,17,1,73,73,73,1,16,17,16,17,16,18,1,18,1,18,16,16,1,1,17,16,1,17,18,18,1,18,16,18,18,16,17,17,18,1,1,16,17,16,1,17,73,73,73,18,18,1,16,17,16,1,17,18,16,1,16,18,16,17,18,17,17,16,1,1,18,17,16,17,17,18,17,18,16,16,18,1,18,1,16,17,73,73,73,1,1,17,16,1,17,18,17,17,17,1,1,17,17,18,17,17,16,16,17,1,1,1,16,18,18,17,16,18,18,1,1,17,1,16,17,1,73,73,73,1,17,17,1,17,17,1,18,18,16,1,1,17,57,17,18,18